				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "604ccb99-1079-4965-ae85-2695c054b437")
	)
	(text "  - K803 JW1FSN contact pad mapping (COM 6 / NO 4 / NC 2) against the Panasonic drawing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 194.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23bb116b-08a3-4dbd-8d4c-ce882bb92277")
	)
	(text "  - DAPLink k20dx HIC pin assignments (SWCLK PTC5, SWDIO PTC6, nRESET PTB1, LED PTD4, UART1 PTC3/4)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 197.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ccc7b75-f504-4090-9028-f810930d7455")
	)
	(text "  - TPS54560B compensation values; TPS2553 ILIM at bring-up; TPS26630 UVLO/ILIM"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 200.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "938564a6-1768-4084-abff-241e094a2818")
	)
	(text "  - STUSB4500 operation from VSYS alone (J17 programmer, no VBUS); PCA9517A isolation with VCC(B) = 0"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 203.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "83caa224-cd94-4e03-946e-06927ff18305")
	)
	(text "  - USB2517 VBUS_DET divider (10k/22k) vs the EVB; LED_A/B strap pull-downs"
